  "title": "智慧园区，实现多系统统一管理及联动",
  "date": "2024-05-13",
  "summary": "智慧园区?是指利用信息技术、互联网技术和物联网技术等现代科技手段对园区进行全面智能化改造和管理的一种新型园区模式。智慧园区通过数字化、智能化的手段，提升园区的管理效率、服务水平，改善居民、企业的生活和工作环境，实现可持续发展。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-609.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-5-13/20245131524568175.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><a href=\"https://www.guhecloud.com/programme/park.html\" target=\"_self\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">智慧园区</span></strong></a><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">是指利用信息技术、互联网技术和物联网技术等现代科技手段对园区进行全面智能化改造和管理的一种新型园区模式。智慧园区通过数字化、智能化的手段，提升园区的管理效率、服务水平，改善居民、企业的生活和工作环境，实现可持续发展。</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">今天古河云科技小编就来给大家聊一聊智慧园区的功能都有哪些？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-5-13/20245131524143194.png\" title=\"141\" alt=\"141\" /><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0px;font-size:14px;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0px;font-size:14px;\">安防系统</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">包括视频监控、入侵检测、智能门禁等，保障园区内居民、企业的人身和财产安全。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">能耗</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">管理</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">系统</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">通过智能电表、能源监测系统等手段，实现对园区用电、用水等能源资源的监控和管理，提升能源利用效率。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">通行管理系统</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">包括智能停车系统、交通流量监测系统等，优化园区内部的交通组织，提升交通效率，减少交通拥堵和事故发生率。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">智能环境监测</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">通过传感器监测空气质量、噪音水平、环境温度等指标，实时监测园区环境状况，为改善环境质量提供数据支持。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">智能垃圾分类处理</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">采用智能垃圾桶、垃圾分类回收系统等技术手段，提倡居民进行垃圾分类，实现资源回收再利用。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">6.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">智能建筑管理</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">利用智能建筑管理系统对建筑设备、消防设施等进行远程监控和管理，提高建筑运行效率，降低能耗。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">7.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">智能社区服务</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">通过手机</span>App等平台，提供智能社区服务，包括社区活动信息发布、物业服务申请、邻里互助等功能，提升居民生活便利性。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-5-13/20245131524568175.png\" title=\"智慧楼宇\" alt=\"智慧楼宇\" /><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">8.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">数据共享与开放</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">促进园区内各类信息系统的数据共享与互通，实现园区内各部门之间的信息互联互通，提升管理效率。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">9.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">智能健康管理</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">建立健康档案管理系统，通过智能穿戴设备、远程医疗等技术手段，实现对居民健康状况的监测和管理。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">10.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">社区智能化运营</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">整合社区资源，开展智能化运营，提高社区服务水平，提升社区居民的生活质量。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">总的来说，智慧园区通过信息化、智能化手段，实现对园区内各方面的全面管理和服务优化，提升园区的智能化水平，为居民、企业提供更加便利、高效、安全、舒适的生活与工作环境。</span></p>",
